---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Falck | Idea Studio"
  description="Turn fuzzy ideas into clear, shippable plans with Falck's Idea Studio."
  theme="light"
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-24 pb-20">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 backdrop-grid opacity-60"></div>
      <div class="absolute -top-20 left-[10%] h-[320px] w-[320px] rounded-full bg-emerald-300/40 blur-[140px] glow-pulse"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-[-25%] right-[6%] h-[420px] w-[420px] rounded-full bg-sky-300/40 blur-[160px] float-soft"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6 reveal">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/70 px-4 py-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-600 border border-white/80">
          Idea Studio
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Turn fuzzy ideas into a plan you can ship</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
          The Idea Studio takes your notes, messy screenshots, and "what if we tried this" thoughts and turns them into
          clear steps. Falck keeps it human, actionable, and ready for real work. Think of it as a calm producer that never
          says "can you just do a quick Figma?".
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <Button href="/download">Download Falck</Button>
          <Button href="/features" variant="secondary">Back to the tour</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] items-center">
      <div class="space-y-4 reveal">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-emerald-500">From idea to action</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-950">A friendly prompt that gets you unstuck</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Falck asks just enough to make the next step clear. You describe the outcome, Falck proposes the steps, and you
          stay in control the whole way. It even politely stops you from turning a "small tweak" into a six-week epic.
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            Turn vague ideas into crisp, doable tasks
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            Keep the outcome-focused plan visible
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            Get a gentle nudge when you drift
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="app-window reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="app-window-bar">
          <span>Falck Desktop</span>
          <span>Idea Studio</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-400">
            <span>Plan Builder</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-500">Drafting plan</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-2">
            <div class="surface-muted px-4 py-3 text-sm">
              <p class="font-semibold">Goal</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">"Refresh the onboarding story"</p>
            </div>
            <div class="surface-muted px-4 py-3 text-sm">
              <p class="font-semibold">Plan</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Write copy, update layout, review with team</p>
            </div>
            <div class="surface-dark px-4 py-3 text-sm">
              <p class="font-semibold">Next step</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-emerald-100/70">Review copy and highlight the wins</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100/80 bg-emerald-50 px-4 py-3 text-xs text-emerald-700">
            Friendly reminder: "small change" is not a personality trait.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="surface p-6 reveal">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-emerald-500">Clarity</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Explain it like a human</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
          Falck captures what you mean, not just what you typed. It turns rambles into a clean checklist your team can
          trust.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="surface p-6 reveal-delay-1">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-slate-500">Momentum</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Stay in flow</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
          Every step is nudged forward. If you drift, Falck gently waves you back without the guilt trip.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="surface p-6 reveal-delay-2">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-slate-500">Reality check</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Ship real code, not vibes</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
          It is still the actual product. When you hit share, engineers see code and intent, not a speculative mockup.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto px-6 pb-28">
    <div class="surface p-10 md:p-12 text-center reveal">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-400">Keep exploring</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Every feature is built to feel calm</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Want more? Explore setup, sharing, and the rest of the Falck flow designed for non-technical builders.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <Button href="/features/setup-concierge">Setup Concierge</Button>
        <Button href="/features/share-updates" variant="secondary">Share updates</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
